+## 11. Neurodiverging (gift guide)
+
+**To:** contact@neurodiverging.com
+**Subject:** A neurodivergent-made shop for your gift guide
+
+> Hi Danielle,
+>
+> I'm Sam, I'm neurodivergent, and I run a small shop called Frog Logic from my lounge. I make tees, mugs and prints with the words we actually use for how it feels (Overstimulated, Shutdown Mode, Late Diagnosed), plus a cosy Christmas range with a frog who is "socially hibernating" until January.
+>
+> I know you put your gift guides together around now, so I wanted to share it in case it's a fit. The tees, mugs, prints and notebooks are made and shipped inside the US, so there are no import fees for your listeners.
+>
+> Shop: https://froglogic.co.uk
+> Christmas set (US): https://froglogic.co.uk/p/christmas-set-us/
+>
+> Happy to send photos or answer anything. Thank you for what you do.
+>
+> Sam, Frog Logic
+
+---
